thinking
**Fixing CommandBuilder chaining and error handling**

CommandBuilder's arg method returns unit, breaking chaining from new, so calls must be sequential. TerminalError lacks Debug, so I've replaced expect calls with match to handle errors by accessing code/message fields directly, avoiding Debug requirements. Tests using expect_err will also use match now.
